## Architecture

One cohesive forensic IP enforcement pipeline. Prefer `us_ipforce_*` modules.

Key entry points:
- `python3 us_ipforce.py`
- `python3 us_ipforce_monolith.py`
- `python3 us_ipforce_monolith_live.py`
- `python3 us_ipforce_deterministic_all.py run`
- `python3 court_ready_forensic_blueprint.py run`

Legacy `ARGUS_ULTIMA.py` / `omega_aegis_*` / `aegis_*` / `us_ip_force_*` filenames are shims only.

## Conventions

- Extend existing US IPFORCE monoliths; avoid parallel reimplementations.
- Data rosters are JSON in `data/` — sync via `scripts/sync_*.py`.
- Dependencies: `requirements.txt`.
- Agent branches use `cursor/<descriptive-name>-<suffix>` naming.

